# Conformance probe pack for groups (spec 0.7) on the `geojson` wire. Public.
# No kinds. A list of object items with a nested list in a `properties` member,
# and a list of scalar items in a top-level member.
format  conformance-groups-geojson
version 0.7.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses    probe
wire    geojson
field   uid  id            string
field   lon  geometry.lon  float
field   lat  geometry.lat  float
group   probe.items  properties.items
  field  probe.label  name  string
  field  probe.qty    n     int
  group  probe.subs   subs
    field  probe.tag  t  string
    field  probe.val  v  int
  end
end
group   probe.names  names
  field  probe.tag  .  string
end
